#page
  head
    link(rel="stylesheet", href="/css/update.css")
  .update-header
    video(autoplay muted loop playsinline style="pointer-events: none;")
      source(src="/starrynight.mp4" type="video/mp4")
    h1.page-title
      .heart-container
        span.heart-icon(style="color:#b388ff;font-size:2.5rem;margin:0 5px;animation:heartbeat 1.5s ease-in-out infinite 0.2s;") ❤
        .heart-shadow(style="animation:shadow-beat 1.5s ease-in-out infinite 0.2s;")
      .heart-container
        span.heart-icon(style="color:#ff7eb3;font-size:2.5rem;margin:0 5px;animation:heartbeat 1.5s ease-in-out infinite;") ❤
        .heart-shadow(style="animation:shadow-beat 1.5s ease-in-out infinite;")
      .heart-container
        span.heart-icon(style="color:#4a9ff5;font-size:2.5rem;margin:0 5px;animation:heartbeat 1.5s ease-in-out infinite 0.5s;") ❤
        .heart-shadow(style="animation:shadow-beat 1.5s ease-in-out infinite 0.5s;")
    p.update-subtitle 每一次心跳都是进步的见证，记录博客成长轨迹
    .development-notice
      span.development-text 正在开发中...
  #article-container
    .timeline-container
      .timeline
        each item in site.data.update.updates
          .timeline-item
            .timeline-content
              .date= item.date
              h3
                i(class=item.icon)
                = item.title
              p.content= item.content
              ul.updates
                each detail in item.details
                  li= detail
              .tags
                each tag in item.tags
                  span.tag= tag